      hu: ["A torony teljes magassága körülbelül 84 méter.", "A JW Marriott szálloda 2014-ben nyílt meg hivatalosan az épületben.", "Ez volt a régió első bevásárlóközpontja, ahol megjelent a Louis Vuitton.", "Az épület modern parkolórendszerrel rendelkezik több mint 1000 jármű számára.", "Az Avenida Winston Churchill és a Gustavo Mejía Ricart kereszteződésében áll.", "Az üvegszerkezetű építészetet az energiahatékonyságáért is elismerték."],
      ro: ["Turnul are o înălțime totală de aproximativ 84 de metri.", "Hotelul JW Marriott din turn a fost deschis oficial în anul 2014.", "A fost primul centru comercial din regiune care a găzduit branduri precum Louis Vuitton.", "Clădirea dispune de un sistem de parcare modern pentru peste 1.000 de vehicule.", "Este situat la intersecția dintre Avenida Winston Churchill și Gustavo Mejía Ricart.", "Arhitectura de sticlă a fost premiată pentru eficiența sa energetică."],
      en: ["The tower has a total height of approximately 84 meters.", "The JW Marriott hotel within the tower officially opened in 2014.", "It was the first mall in the region to host luxury brands like Louis Vuitton.", "The building features a modern parking system for over 1,000 vehicles.", "Located at the intersection of Winston Churchill and Gustavo Mejía Ricart avenues.", "The glass-heavy architecture has been recognized for its energy efficiency."],
