      en: ["Construction began in 1550, with main buildings completed around 1553.", "The first female monastery in the Americas, founded for the Poor Clares.", "Francis Drake used the monastery as his headquarters during the 1586 siege.", "The church houses valuable religious artworks from the colonial era.", "Partially damaged by a severe earthquake in 1673.", "The facade displays a transition from Plateresque to Baroque architectural styles."],
